Variant of cloud-vms-vs-containers-what-customers-buy.svg (see
cloud-vms-vs-containers-what-customers-buy.svg.prompt for the base figure).

Identical figure, but everything is blurred and dimmed except:
- the JRE workloads (the "JRE: spring-boot service" row in A's VM and the
  "JRE: spring-boot" container in C's platform VM),
- the VM boxes themselves (green rectangles incl. their labels),
- the hardware layer,
- the diagram title.

Implemented with an SVG feGaussianBlur filter (stdDeviation 3) plus
opacity 0.5 on every non-focused element, keeping the original document order
so the sharp elements stay on top of their blurred surroundings.
